3	Proposed Flow
The in addition to LDAP authentication, OTP verification to be added.
  


5	Assumptions
•	Bank to arrange for SMS and Mail service integration for sending OTP.
•	APIs related to SMS and Email should be reachable and working. 


6	Limitations
•	FinCore will send the code using email and SMS, but can’t guarantee the delivery of the same.
•	In case any connectivity issue/downtime of LDAP, SMS, Email services, user can’t login into FinCore application. 




